edb/ref 17592186564231} {:answer/id #uuid "d054c24f-b046-5e4b-9c2e-39da68f8ec3b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564298} {:answer/id #uuid "e97016e4-6a8f-5328-b33e-52efd1dc2a5e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564338} {:answer/id #uuid "ed15a969-b552-5a08-90d0-2f86afcf0b42" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564349} {:answer/id #uuid "f0704e6b-a2ce-5b70-bceb-9f22d2c7b3f1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564357}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e97016e4-6a8f-5328-b33e-52efd1dc2a5e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564338} :answer-field/id #uuid "9768eaaa-8761-51c7-87c0-8475f53214f4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186564423}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "0e6ba761-66c0-5454-8a49-a1749f6fb11e" :question/math-academy-id "q-81999" :question/problem "Find the root of $f(x)=2{log}_{2}⁡(x)-6.$" :question/worked-solution "To find the root of $f(x),$  we must solve $f(x)=0:$\n\n$$\n2{log}_{2}⁡(x)-6=0\n$$\n\nWe solve this equation by making $x$ the subject, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{log}_{2}⁡(x)-6 & =0 \\\\ 2{log}_{2}⁡(x) & =6 \\\\ {log}_{2}⁡(x) & =3 \\\\ {2}^{{log}_{2}⁡(x)} & ={2}^{3} \\\\ x & =8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the root of $f(x)$ is $x=8.$"}]}
